#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:54
#: b9c1ca37c2aa46029d0b2c827be6bde7
msgid "RC input is configured by default via the USART2 RX input. It supports all unidirectional RC protocols except PPM. FPort and full duplex protocols, like CRSF/ELRS, will need to use TX2 also."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:56
#: 3134ae68aecc4fa89594928488922128
msgid "If the receiver is FPort or a full duplex protocol, then the receiver must be tied to the USART2 TX pin and `SERIAL2_OPTIONS <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#serial2-options>`_ = 7 (invert TX/RX, half duplex), and `RSSI_TYPE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#rssi-type>`_ =3."
msgstr ""

